<article class="env-definition" id="0GCV">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0GCV">Definition <span data-tag="0GCV">88.19.2</span>.</a> Let $\varphi : A \to B$ be a continuous ring homomorphism between adic Noetherian topological rings, i.e., $\varphi $ is an arrow of $\textit{WAdm}^{Noeth}$. We say $\varphi $ is <em>rig-etale</em> if the equivalent conditions of Lemma <a href="/tag/0GCU" data-tag="0GCU">88.19.1</a> hold. </p>
